== Code chunks <code-chunks>
=== R chunks <r-chunks>



#srcbox[#raw("x <- 1:10
mean(x)", block: true, lang: "r")]

#outbox[#raw("> [1] 5.5", block: true)]

==== Echo fenced <echo-fenced>



#srcbox[#raw("```{r, chunk-2}
#| echo: fenced
summary(mtcars$mpg)
```", block: true, lang: "r")]

#outbox[#raw(">    Min. 1st Qu.  Median    Mean 3rd Qu.    Max. 
>   10.40   15.43   19.20   20.09   22.80   33.90", block: true)]

==== Figure from R <sec-rfig>



